      "updated": 1788759101803,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) is it better for security?\n2) why not to just leave transfer from in\nPool, after all other execution.\nPractically - gonna be the same.",
      "rawText": "1) is it better for security?\n2) why not to just leave transfer from in\nPool, after all other execution.\nPractically - gonna be the same.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) is it better for security?\n2) why not to just leave transfer from in\nPool, after all other execution.\nPractically - gonna be the same.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "k7XgQfPv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -445.4215440441346,
      "y": 215.29122181564458,
      "width": 428.7596435546875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
